{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0700"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge film-media/film","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/film-media__film.g1.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",2],["-","Jackson's"],["+","Jackson,"],["=",1],["+","the bearded New Zealander from Wellington who had started out with low-budget splatter comedies, shot his "],["=",30],["-","were"],["+","at"],["=",1],["-","shot"],["+","home"],["=",374],["+"," A year later Cumberbatch was cracking codes as the mathematician Alan Turing in \"The Imitation Game\" (2014)."],["=",321],["+","The oldest member of the Fellowship had the deepest roots in the books. Christopher Lee (1922–2015), already famous as Hammer's Dracula and as the Bond villain Scaramanga, played the corrupted wizard Saruman; a lifelong reader of Tolkien, he was the only person involved in Jackson's films who had actually met J. R. R. Tolkien. Between two trips to Middle-earth he joined another saga as Count Dooku in \"Star Wars\".\n\n"],["=",279]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",2],["-","Jacksons"],["+","Jackson,"],["=",1],["+","der bärtige Neuseeländer aus Wellington, der mit Splatterkomödien für wenig Geld angefangen hatte, drehte seine "],["=",26],["-","wurden "],["=",2],["+","seiner Heimat "],["=",10],["-","Besetzung"],["+","Besetzung,"],["=",1],["-","gedreht, "],["=",357],["+"," Ein Jahr später knackte Cumberbatch als Mathematiker Alan Turing in „The Imitation Game“ (2014) Codes."],["=",269],["+","Das älteste Mitglied der Gemeinschaft hatte die tiefsten Wurzeln in den Büchern. Christopher Lee (1922–2015), schon berühmt als Dracula der Hammer-Studios und als Bond-Bösewicht Scaramanga, spielte den verdorbenen Zauberer Saruman; als lebenslanger Tolkien-Leser war er der Einzige unter allen an Jacksons Filmen Beteiligten, der J. R. R. Tolkien tatsächlich begegnet war. Zwischen zwei Reisen nach Mittelerde schloss er sich als Graf Dooku in „Star Wars“ einer weiteren Saga an.\n\n"],["=",269]]}]},
